<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article class="prose page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE LIST</p>
    <h1>Small computers.<br />Good games.</h1>

    <p>
      Potato Approved is a deliberately simple catalogue for finding PC games
      that don't need modern gaming hardware.
    </p>

    <p>
      Built with
      <a href="https://astro.build/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Astro</a>,
      hosted on
      <a href="https://neocities.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Neocities</a>,
      and powered by potatoes.
    </p>

    <p>
      I don't really know what else to put here, but hey, it's free.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
